          ai: 'Game: Loba. South American Rummy. 2-5 players, 108 cards (2 decks + 4 Jokers). Deal 11 each. Draw from stock or discard. Meld sets (3+ same rank) and sequences (3+ consecutive same suit). Jokers wild. Can lay off on any meld. Discard to end turn. Go out to end round. Penalties: Joker=50, Ace=20, Face=10, Others=face value. Lowest total wins.',
